Description: notify systemd once the server is ready
 The server sends READY=1 to $NOTIFY_SOCKET (the sd_notify protocol, without
 libsystemd) from a Rocket liftoff fairing, which runs once the listener is
 bound, after database migrations. The Type=notify unit thus becomes active
 when vaultwarden can serve. Without $NOTIFY_SOCKET nothing changes.
